      "text": "🧪 Node 5: Tri-Layer Tester<br>(Pure Mechanical\nEngine • 0 LLM Cost)\n\n• Layer 1: npm run build / vitest run\n\n• Layer 2: GET /api/agent/vite-runtime-errors\n\n• Layer 3: Scraped container runtime crash log\n\n• Computes: sha256(error fingerprint)",
